WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.900
Dee Jay begins the heavy-to-medium link.

2
00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:04.000
Dee Jay extends into crouching heavy and standing heavy.

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.650
Dee Jay repeats the heavy extension.

4
00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:14.550
Dee Jay cancels Machine Gun Uppercut into Level 3.

5
00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:16.550
Dee Jay completes the cinematic finisher.
